    "question": "দেখান যে, (aᵖ)^(q−r) . (aᑫ)^(r−p) . (aʳ)^(p−q) = 1",
    "steps": [
      "L.H.S = (aᵖ)^(q−r).(aᑫ)^(r−p).(aʳ)^(p−q)",
      "= a^(pq−pr).a^(qr−pq).a^(pr−qr)",
      "= a^(pq−pr+qr−pq+pr−qr)",
      "= a⁰",
      "= 1",
      "= R.H.S"
    ],
    "answer": "প্রমাণিত"
  },
